      "child.tryAgain on child.background is 1.14:1. The band always carries the hint icon in onTryAgain.",
      "parent.border on parent.background is 1.28:1. Decorative only; anything tappable uses borderStrong.",
      "The parent-gate lock icon (child.borderStrong at 75% opacity) on child.background is 2.42:1. Deliberate: a low-key icon so children do not press it; adults are told where it is.",
